WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.801
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.467
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:09.567
When asked yesterday about his
age as he runs for re-election,

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:12.534
President Biden said that it
doesn't register with him.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:15.868
Okay. I know you're trying
to play it cool,

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:18.868
but you made it sound
like a symptom.

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:21.100
"My age, I never remember."

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:24.934
That's right.
When asked about his age,

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:27.200
President Biden said,
"I took a hard look at it

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.367
before I decided to run.
And I feel good."

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:32.000
Listen, we don't care
how you feel now.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.300
Did you see what eight years
did to Obama?

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.467
If you get re-elected,

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:38.801
this is what you're going to
look like

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:40.434
by the end of 2028.

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:42.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.567
President Biden greeted kids
today on the White House

00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:48.133
South Lawn as part of
Take Your Child to Work Day.

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.934
Unfortunately,
it was a trap set up

00:00:49.934 --> 00:00:52.567
by Congress
to arrest Hunter Biden.

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:58.467
Former president Trump's
new book, "Letters to Trump,"

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:02.200
went on sale this week
for $95 -- $95!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:06.634
Let me give you the gist
and save you the cash.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:08.634
"Dear Mr. President,
for the last time,

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:12.434
the Grimace cannot attend
your inauguration.

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:14.367
We hope this will be
the final word on the matter.

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:16.901
Sincerely, McDonald's."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:19.133
A source recently told
"People" magazine that former

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.534
president Trump respects
and admires former

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:24.267
First Lady Melania Trump
and wants to make her happy.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.501
But he plans to stay married
to her anyway.

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:29.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.367
After being fired
from Fox News on Monday,

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:33.334
Tucker Carlson
posted a video last night

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:34.667
to Twitter and said,

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:37.734
"Where can you still find
Americans saying true things?"

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:40.167
Well, hell, you've already tried
Fox News and Twitter.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:43.968
I'm out of ideas. I don't know.
Maybe Wall Street.

00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:45.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:48.300
A bipartisan group of senators
yesterday introduced

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.567
the Protecting Kids
on Social Media Act,

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:54.234
which would set the minimum
age to 13 for platforms

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:56.901
including Instagram,
Facebook and TikTok.

00:01:56.901 --> 00:02:01.167
Wait, you're trying to keep kids
under 13 from using Facebook?

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.501
What's next? You're not going
to let them wait in line

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:06.601
with you at the bank?

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:08.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:12.701
Workers in Wales recently
misspelled the word "school"

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:14.601
while repainting
a section of road.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.801
To be fair, this is how
you spell school in Welsh.

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:23.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.000
A court in Germany
ruled yesterday

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.534
that the tenants of a building
do not qualify for reduced rent

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.467
because their landlords
sunbathe naked

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:32.701
in the courtyard.
Said the judge,

00:02:32.701 --> 00:02:34.767
"Think of it this way --
free sundial."

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:38.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:41.033
[ Light applause ]

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:43.901
Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
I don't need your applause.

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:45.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.534 --> 00:02:47.100
But I stand by that joke.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.267 --> 00:02:51.234
And finally,
according to a new report,

00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:52.767
trained dogs can help detect

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:54.901
coronavirus infections
in schools.

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:57.868
Cats can, too. They just won't.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.868 --> 00:02:59.200
That was a monologue, everybody.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.634
We're off.
We're off and running.

